## [0002] 2026-09-16 — Legal pages ported, old HTML project removed

**Ask:** entire project in Next.js + TypeScript; all HTML removed.

### Status of the HTML question

This project never contained an HTML source file. The `.html` files referenced
in earlier verification logs were `.next/` **build output** — the static pages
Next.js prerenders on every `next build`. `.next/` has been deleted, and the
empty unused `public/` folder with it (later recreated to hold the preserved
illustrations below).

The real HTML lived in a **separate, older project** at `Downloads/fidium/`,
which held `legacy/index.html` plus 8 legal pages. That project has now been
deleted entirely, after porting its legal content here.

### New: centralized legal content

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| **`lib/legal.ts`** | All 11 legal documents as structured data. Entity name, phone, address, domain and mailboxes are `{tokens}` resolved from `SITE` in `lib/content.ts`. |
| `app/[slug]/page.tsx` | One dynamic route renders every legal page. `generateStaticParams` prerenders all 11; `dynamicParams = false` 404s anything else. |
| `components/layout/LegalPage.tsx` | Rewritten: renders block data, builds an "On this page" TOC from the headings, and turns `[text](/route)` and bare emails into real links (no `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`). |

**Deleted:** `app/privacy/`, `app/terms/`, `app/accessibility/`, `app/do-not-sell/`
— all four are now data entries in `lib/legal.ts`.

### Legal routes (11, all prerendered)

`/privacy` · `/terms` · `/disclaimer` · `/service-fulfillment` · `/cookies` ·
`/do-not-sell` · `/tcpa` · `/marketing-policy` · `/pci-dss` · `/trademarks` ·
`/accessibility`

Seven of these (disclaimer, service-fulfillment, cookies, TCPA, marketing
policy, PCI DSS, trademarks) are newly ported and matter for Google Ads telecom
compliance. The footer legal row and `sitemap.ts` are both generated from
`LEGAL_DOCS`, so adding a document there wires up its page, metadata, sitemap
entry and footer link with no new file.

### Edits made while porting

- Stripped every **"Last updated: July 7, 2026"** date stamp (negative constraint).
- `[Reseller Legal Name]` → `{entity}` token.
- **"reseller" → "retailer"** throughout, matching this site's language.
- Old phone `1.844.434.3486` and `your-domain.com` mailboxes → `{phone}` and
  `{email:*}` tokens resolved from `SITE`.
- "network provider" → "Fidium" for clarity.
- **Dropped unverified claims** carried over from the old copy: the "30-day
  money-back trial", "reward cards" and "streaming bonus". None of these appear
  on fidiumfiber.com, so stating them would be an unsupported factual claim.
  Replaced with the verified month-to-month / no-ETF terms.

### Also added

- `SITE.email` in `lib/content.ts` — the mailbox names used by the legal pages.
- `public/illustrations/` — 8 line illustrations plus `og-cover.svg` rescued
  from the old project before deleting it (~17 KB total). **Currently unused**;
  delete the folder if you do not want them.

### Verification

- Build clean: **18 static pages**, homepage still **101 kB** First Load JS.
- 0 date stamps, 0 unresolved `{tokens}`, 0 "reseller" wording across all routes.
- 107 `tel:` links across all pages, **all** carrying `data-call-cta`.
- CTA labels still only "Call to order" plus the header/footer phone number.
- Zero horizontal overflow at 320px on the legal pages.

### To revert this entry

Delete `lib/legal.ts`, `app/[slug]/`, `public/illustrations/`, restore the four
original `app/<slug>/page.tsx` files and the `Legal` column in `FOOTER.columns`.
The deleted `Downloads/fidium/` project cannot be restored.

