## Placeholders to replace before launch

These are in `lib/content.ts`, at the top, in the `SITE` object:

| Field | Current value | Action |
|---|---|---|
| `entity` | `Fiberline Communications LLC` | Your registered legal entity |
| `shortName` | `Fiberline` | Short form used in prose |
| `phoneDisplay` / `phoneHref` | `(888) 425-0568` | Your call-tracking number (**both** fields) |
| `address` | `1 Commerce Way, Suite 200, Manchester, NH 03101` | Your registered business address |
| `domain` | `fidium-authorized-retailer.com` | Your production domain |

Nothing else in the codebase hardcodes any of these.

